Package: fuxi-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: fuxi port <noreply@localhost>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: fuxi-device, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, kbd, systemd
Recommends: denial, phosh, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Suggests: plasma-mobile, kscreen
Description: Xiaomi 13 (fuxi, SM8550) graphical session glue
 Session units and helpers for the Xiaomi 13 on mainline Linux:
  - denial.service (default mobile session on tty7), plasmamobile.service,
    phosh.service drop-ins (user bus, chvt 7, logind seat, wayland-0)
  - fuxi-session: switch between Denial / Phosh / Plasma Mobile and clean up
    leftover compositors
  - fuxi-autorotate: iio-sensor-proxy orientation -> kscreen for Plasma
  - opt-in Denial ambient-light brightness and explicit power preferences
  - fuxi-desktop-app: software-render fallback when no GPU render node
  - xdg-desktop-portal preference for Phosh (conffile)
